Description: MARS digital message handler
 MARSComm sends, receives and stores MARS digital messages through serial
 and network modems, MS-DMT and the AN/PRC-160.  It builds USMTF messages from
 the standard MessageCreator templates, handles ACP 127 and 16L addressing,
 net strips, chat and orderwire, and encrypts traffic with the
 NGT-compatible MSC cipher.
 .
 Each user's settings, databases, cipher keys and logs are kept in
 ~/.local/share/MARSComm.

