Description: MIL-STD-110A Digital Modem Terminal
 MS-DMT (Multi-Speed Data Modem Terminal) is a Qt6-based cross-platform
 application for digital radio communications using MIL-STD-110A modem
 protocols.
 .
 Features include:
  - Multiple data rates: 75-4800 bps
  - Multiple interleaving modes (Short/Long/Variable)
  - TCP/IP control interface for external applications
  - Serial port radio control (PTT/CAT)
  - Constellation display for signal quality visualization
  - Support for 40+ radio transceivers

